note: design 54.4: in a rejected step, the last line of the gap list names the options for the command of the step. No step is stored.
note: the negative case is `rules/gap_list_lines`: an accepted step names the command `semilla fact`. Design 84: the option names `far` (no checked configuration compiles it: no result); the line of `limit` has "MIR changes" and the two forms.
rule-: R71.3-1
rule+: R54.4-7
option: --change
option: idle=more
exit: 1
must_match: \? 1 place: changed literal `1` → `2` .*\n      in: depot::far\n      lines: .*\n      to state it: --change 'depot::far=TEXT'\n
must_match: \n  to state them, add these options to the command of the step: --change 'depot::far=TEXT'\n
must_not_match: add facts to the stored step
must_not_match: semilla fact
